The ADV7511 project works using the API library found at https://www.analog.com/media/en/dsp-hardware-software/software-modules/ADV7511_API_Library.exe

To build the project copy the "TX" folder from the "Src" folder in the
library installation folder into this project directory.

For the Xilinx CMake flow, source the Vitis environment and provide the exported
hardware design with ``--hardware``:

```
source ~/.xilinx/2025.1/Vitis/settings64.sh
python3 tools/scripts/no_os_build.py build --project adv7511 --variant demo \
  --board zed --hardware /path/to/adv7511_zed.xsa
```
